# Run these queries to validate Phase 9 implementation:
#
# ✓ Query 1: Verify source-to-usage matching works
# ✓ Query 2: Confirm all constraint sets are properly defined
# ✓ Query 3: Check that quality assessments compute correctly
# ✓ Query 4: Validate fit-for-purpose analysis
# ✓ Query 5: Ensure usage points declare their requirements
# ✓ Query 7: Verify requirement comparison shows quality spectrum
# ✓ Query 8: Confirm reuse opportunity identification
# ✓ Query 9: Validate violated constraint tracking
# ✓ Query 10: Verify constraint hierarchy reasoning
